🇺🇸🌏NEW VIDEO: US Policy Papers: Crystal Balls Seeing into the Future

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/GQ3wo5sfmms?si=aiwCKqnTmqSEXTaM

▪️Were the public to ignore the daily political circus performed across both the mainstream media and even much of the alternative media, and were to read policy papers funded by the very corporations driving US foreign and domestic policy, they would see developments YEARS before they took shape; 

▪️Policy papers lay out US policy and the steps required to carry them out and even describe the narratives and deceptions needed to get the public to buy into these policies; 

▪️Policy papers give clues not only to what the US will do and how, but give insight into parallel activities taking place as these papers' policies adapt to more recent developments; 

▪️Overcoming the daily political circus and exposing the actual policies the US is pursuing, how, and why, deprives the US of one of its most powerful weapons - information and narrative dominance and the division and distractions it causes; 

▪️PLEASE! Read the policy papers!
